{"seq":20,"slug":"privacy-engineering","title":"隐私工程","stage":"DONE","category":"devops-tools","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"隐私工程\">隐私工程</h1><p>隐私工程是将隐私保护从法律条文转化为可验证的技术控制措施的工程学科。它不同于传统的合规审查——后者往往是事后补救，而隐私工程强调在系统设计阶段就将数据保护嵌入架构决策中。2026 年，随着全球超过 20 个司法管辖区实施强制性隐私法规，以及 AI 系统对个人数据的大规模处理，隐私工程已从&quot;nice-to-have&quot;变为工程团队的核心能力。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦于隐私保护的工程实现——从 Privacy by Design 原则的代码落地，到差分隐私、联邦学习等隐私增强技术（PETs）的生产部署，再到 GDPR/CCPA 的自动化合规流水线。与兄弟 hub 的分工边界：密钥管理（<code>11_secrets-management</code>）处理凭证与加密密钥的全生命周期，本 hub 不重复覆盖加密基础设施本身；特性开关（<code>19_feature-flags-progressive-delivery</code>）处理渐进发布，本 hub 关注隐私相关的用户分群与同意信号如何与发布策略联动；SRE（<code>15_site-reliability-engineering</code>）关注系统可靠性，本 hub 侧重隐私事件的检测与响应。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径因读者背景而异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>后端工程师：foundations → techniques → operations → compliance</li>\n<li>安全/合规工程师：foundations → compliance → operations → techniques</li>\n<li>数据/ML 工程师：foundations → techniques（重点差分隐私与联邦学习）→ compliance → operations</li>\n</ul>\n<p>前置知识：基本的密码学概念（对称/非对称加密、哈希）、HTTP/API 安全基础、至少一门后端语言的开发经验。如果对密钥管理不熟悉，建议先阅读 <code>11_secrets-management</code> 的基础章节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"隐私工程基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"privacy-by-design","title":"隐私设计原则的工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/foundations/privacy-by-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"threat-modeling-for-privacy","title":"隐私威胁建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/foundations/threat-modeling-for-privacy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-lifecycle-governance","title":"数据生命周期治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/foundations/data-lifecycle-governance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"techniques","title":"隐私增强技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"differential-privacy","title":"差分隐私的工程实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques/differential-privacy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"federated-learning","title":"联邦学习架构与部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques/federated-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-enhancing-technologies","title":"隐私增强技术全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/techniques/privacy-enhancing-technologies"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance","title":"合规工程化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gdpr-engineering","title":"GDPR 工程化合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance/gdpr-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ccpa-cpra-implementation","title":"CCPA/CPRA 工程实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance/ccpa-cpra-implementation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-impact-assessment","title":"隐私影响评估自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/compliance/privacy-impact-assessment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"隐私运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-discovery-classification","title":"数据发现与自动分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations/data-discovery-classification"},{"seq":2,"slug":"consent-management-platform","title":"同意管理平台工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations/consent-management-platform"},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-observability-incident","title":"隐私可观测性与事件响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/privacy-engineering/operations/privacy-observability-incident"}]}]}